# /canvas — Supabase project (Project Settings → API in the dashboard).
# Both are PUBLIC_*, so Astro inlines them into the browser bundle. That is
# correct for these two: the anon key is designed to be public and is only as
# permissive as your row-level security policies. Never put the service_role
# key or the database password in here.
PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL="https://rtafnykjewguxutbkegx.supabase.co"
PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=""

# /canvas — tldraw. Required on a real domain: with no key tldraw treats the
# page as "unlicensed-production" and strips the editor out after 5 seconds.
# Localhost and plain http are treated as development and stay watermark-only,
# so a missing key looks fine locally and only breaks once deployed.
# Get a key from https://tldraw.dev (or sales@tldraw.com).
PUBLIC_TLDRAW_LICENSE_KEY=""
